WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:01.640
Dokter mengetuk tepat di bawah

00:00:01.660 --> 00:00:02.500
tempurung lutut,

00:00:02.640 --> 00:00:04.100
kok kaki langsung bergerak?

00:00:04.500 --> 00:00:06.050
Ketukan itu meregangkan

00:00:06.080 --> 00:00:07.280
otot paha depan sesaat.

00:00:07.360 --> 00:00:08.720
Sensor regang di otot

00:00:08.740 --> 00:00:10.050
mengirim sinyal lewat saraf

00:00:10.060 --> 00:00:11.500
menuju sumsum tulang belakang.

00:00:11.920 --> 00:00:12.750
Dari sana,

00:00:12.760 --> 00:00:13.720
sinyal dikirim kembali

00:00:13.720 --> 00:00:14.550
ke otot paha depan.

00:00:15.020 --> 00:00:16.420
Otot berkontraksi,

00:00:16.440 --> 00:00:17.620
lalu tungkai bawah terangkat.

00:00:18.220 --> 00:00:19.420
Inilah refleks lutut.

00:00:19.740 --> 00:00:21.360
Gerakannya cepat karena memakai

00:00:21.380 --> 00:00:22.400
jalur refleks melalui

00:00:22.420 --> 00:00:23.550
sumsum tulang belakang.

00:00:23.900 --> 00:00:25.220
Dokter memeriksanya untuk

00:00:25.240 --> 00:00:26.360
membantu menilai kerja

00:00:26.380 --> 00:00:27.650
jalur saraf dan otot.

00:00:30.100 --> 00:00:34.000
Di MEDCOEL, jelajahi Atlas 3D dan Live 4D Lab.

00:00:34.220 --> 00:00:38.020
Lanjut belajar lewat materi, latihan soal, dan Simulasi Dokter.

00:00:38.320 --> 00:00:40.460
Gratis di medcoel.com.

